# Modules as directories (claude/modules-style-pass.md): `mod Shapes` reads shapes/mod.prism,
# whose own `mod` lines declare `Shapes.Circle` and `Shapes.Square`, each named by its path
# from the root. A qualified name's last segment is the declaration, the rest its module;
# `use Shapes.Circle.*` makes the circle's names bare.
# Written by Claude on the claude-self-hosting branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
mod Shapes
test mod Tests
use Ui
use Shapes.Circle.*

@main: @unit
@main:
    Ui.Label($text=$"{Area 2} {Shapes.Square.Area 2}")
